{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35205","headline":"劝酒二首 二 · 聂夷中","name":"劝酒二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灞上送行客，听唱行客歌。\n适来桥下水，已作渭川波。\n人间荣乐少，四海别离多。\n但恐别离泪，自成苦水河。\n劝尔一杯酒，所赠无余多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}